  "headline": "A Taste of AGI!?",
  "alternativeHeadline": "Primary-Source Forensic Audit of Frontier Agentic Capability vs. Generative Theater",
  "description": "Stripping away keynote hype, what actually differentiates a genuinely useful agentic system from an impressive demo? Through primary-source forensics, we show that durable agentic workflows depend on standard tool contracts (MCP + WebMCP), sandboxed execution, and machine-readable web infrastructure.",
